<p>Hello hello <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/spookybonez" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7178210); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7178210&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609758940" alt="SpookyBonez" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7178210)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/spookybonez" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7178210); return false;">SpookyBonez</a></span>! Welcome to the Wiki! I'm Ralliston, a site author and a member of the Community Outreach Team - with this helpful little comment, I'll try to help you find your way around the site and link a bunch of useful places and links that will help you in your SCP journey.</p>
