<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> Tale</p>
<p><strong>Genre:</strong> Factual, Informative</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout:</strong> Report title and brief summary of purpose, note from report's author, tier explanation, 05 council, ethics committee, administrator, general high level staff</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A report commissioned by the 05 council simplifying and explaining how the different branches of the SCP Foundation interact and their relevant powers and duties. The report will contain an explanation of the 05 council, the ethics committee, the administrator and all their associated staff as well as my own idea for classifying the different levels of authority in the Foundation (this system is currently only planned to be used within the context of the report).</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> A factual report written by a high level member of staff under the orders of the 05 council.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> Provides an understanding of several mysterious and poorly understood groups and individuals.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This information varies between cannons so I will only be able to apply my own personal interpretation. I already have notes on paper but I do not want to commit to a draft until I hear some early feedback from the community.</p>

